    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d8c66797_a31c5742",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_alt_mode_ufp.c",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1329118
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-27T00:55:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just follow pd_ufp_set_enter_mode to store the payload.\n\nI\u0027m not pretty sure how we handle exit mode for bb_retimer.c. It may need to clear the EnterMode message and configure some bb_retimer\u0027s registers. But it may need Intel\u0027s help.",
      "parentUuid": "bde8e885_3c17c41c",
      "revId": "7927e70d3a0142dda6f529a7ba8346322f92fe27",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "95580006_a9ebf11a",
        "filename": "common/usb_pd_alt_mode_ufp.c",
        "patchSetId": 15
      },
      "lineNbr": 11,
      "author": {
        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-28T18:15:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The generic Exit Mode process should handle the BB retimer through the mux setting process. The mux settings during the process should be the same regardless of the active mode that is being exited. So I don\u0027t think we need to store this.",
      "parentUuid": "d8c66797_a31c5742",
      "revId": "7927e70d3a0142dda6f529a7ba8346322f92fe27",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
